      "updated": 1786813168567,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "REST API \nResource Modelling \n    - plural nouns \n    - core entities \n\nGET /events \nGET /events/{id}\nGET /venues\nGET /venues/{id}\nPOSt /events/{id}/bookings\nGTE /boookings/{id}22\n\nPOST /events/create  Dont do that \nno Verb -> No create \nHttp method do that thing \nno verb in url itself   ",
      "fontSize": 24.258710369618537,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "REST API \nResource Modelling \n    - plural nouns \n    - core entities \n\nGET /events \nGET /events/{id}\nGET /venues\nGET /venues/{id}\nPOSt /events/{id}/bookings\nGTE /boookings/{id}22\n\nPOST /events/create  Dont do that \nno Verb -> No create \nHttp method do that thing \nno verb in url itself   ",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.25,
      "rawText": "REST API \nResource Modelling \n    - plural nouns \n    - core entities \n\nGET /events \nGET /events/{id}\nGET /venues\nGET /venues/{id}\nPOSt /events/{id}/bookings\nGTE /boookings/{id}22\n\nPOST /events/create  Dont do that \nno Verb -> No create \nHttp method do that thing \nno verb in url itself   "
    },
