      "text": "Http Methods\n\n1. GET \n2. POST create new data , IMP Not Idempotent \n3. PUT update/replace , its is Idempotent \n4. Patch parital update\n5. DElETE  remove data \n\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Http Methods\n\n1. GET \n2. POST create new data , IMP Not Idempotent \n3. PUT update/replace , its is Idempotent \n4. Patch parital update\n5. DElETE  remove data \n\n",
      "autoResize": true,
